## Review

- **Blocker, high:** `backend/src/yinshi/services/managed_runtime_manager.py:412-417` can restart after an initially current heartbeat becomes stale during reconnect wait. A 119.5-second heartbeat caused one restart after one poll. This can stop an active prompt during transient relay loss.
- **Blocker, high:** `backend/src/yinshi/services/managed_runtime_manager.py:434-437` checks connectivity before checking restart deadline. Simulation accepted reconnect at 10.1 seconds with a 10-second deadline.

